WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.168
Hello, everyone, and welcome

00:00:02.168 --> 00:00:03.902
to our live prime-time special

00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:05.137
"A Closer Look Thursday."

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:06.773
Now, normally,
on our show every night,

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.474
we do a segment called
"A Closer Look"

00:00:08.474 --> 00:00:10.143
that's about 15 minutes long.

00:00:10.143 --> 00:00:12.112
But, since so much
has happened this week,

00:00:12.112 --> 00:00:15.214
we decided to supersize it
from 15 minutes

00:00:15.214 --> 00:00:16.415
to 21 minutes.

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:17.416
It might not sound like a lot,

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.785
but those extra
six minutes, man,

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:20.053
they're gonna blow your mind.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.121
Also, this will be
the first time

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:22.154
we're doing "A Closer Look"

00:00:22.154 --> 00:00:23.188
with commercial breaks

00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:25.158
and I, for one,
can't wait to see

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:27.059
which ads for prescription drugs

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:29.729
NBC thinks pair best
with a rundown of today's news.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:32.231
Xanex, Dramamine, Regeneron?

00:00:32.231 --> 00:00:34.166
Sorry, just trying
to help the president

00:00:34.166 --> 00:00:35.434
pump up the stock price.

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:36.435
And, speaking
of the president --

00:00:36.435 --> 00:00:37.436
That's a segue.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:39.071
We're incredibly good at those.

00:00:39.071 --> 00:00:40.573
There's so much to get to,

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:43.242
from the president's ongoing
election-induced meltdown

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.844
to the White House attempt
to cover up

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:46.679
its expanding COVID outbreak.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:50.250
So, for more on all of that,
it's time for "A Closer Look"

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.350
prime time!

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:55.755
♪♪

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:56.822
I forgot --

00:00:56.822 --> 00:00:59.392
NBC wouldn't pay
for the second camera.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:02.128
This week, our addled president
has been sitting around

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.563
in a mostly deserted
White House infectious zone,

00:01:04.563 --> 00:01:07.066
watching TV
and angrily scream-tweeting

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.367
at all hours of the night.

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.968
The place is turning
into Grey Gardens.

00:01:09.968 --> 00:01:12.171
If Trump gets reelected,
he's gonna be holed up in there

00:01:12.171 --> 00:01:14.206
with long hair and fingernails,

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:16.809
while flies buzz
around Mike Pence's head.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.978
Trump's apparently just been
watching TV and stewing

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.880
