rambled incoherently about,

00:01:52.644 --> 00:01:53.846
honestly, God knows what.

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:55.281
It's impossible to follow,

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:56.949
unless you're deeply immersed

00:01:56.949 --> 00:01:58.952
