00:02:43.028 --> 00:02:44.062 line:0%
I killed Soleimani.

00:02:44.062 --> 00:02:46.132 line:0%
I killed al-Baghdadi.

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:47.333 line:0%
Names that everybody --

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:49.402 line:0%
bigger names
than Osama bin Laden.

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:50.770 line:0%
She's a Communist.

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:53.172 line:0%
They have a boat,
