00:17:55.941 --> 00:17:59.044
and it was like unbelievable.

00:17:59.044 --> 00:18:00.679
I felt good immediately.

00:18:00.679 --> 00:18:04.349
I felt as good three days ago
as I do now.

00:18:04.349 --> 00:18:06.552
-Okay, first of all,
Regeneron sounds like a drug

00:18:06.552 --> 00:18:08.654
an evil corporation
in the movie would use

00:18:08.654 --> 00:18:10.188
to make an army of soldiers

00:18:10.188 --> 00:18:12.257
or genetically engineer
dinosaurs.

00:18:12.257 --> 00:18:14.893
All it's missing is the word
industries at the end.

00:18:14.893 --> 00:18:16.528
"Here at Regeneron Industries,

00:18:16.528 --> 00:18:18.196
we're using
the latest technology

00:18:18.196 --> 00:18:20.198
to create an army
of servant clones

00:18:20.198 --> 00:18:21.800
that definitely will not
rise up against --

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:23.335
What's that banging
on the door?

00:18:23.335 --> 00:18:24.503
Oh, the servant clones?

00:18:24.503 --> 00:18:27.005
Oh, they're rising up?
We'll turn them off.

00:18:27.005 --> 00:18:28.540
They won't turn off?
Well, I don't know."

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:31.443
[ Static crackling ]
Krrrrrrr!

00:18:31.443 --> 00:18:32.444
That was static.

00:18:32.444 --> 00:18:33.512
Krrrrrrr!

00:18:33.512 --> 00:18:34.913
They wouldn't pay
for the second camera.

00:18:34.913 --> 00:18:36.515
They wouldn't give us this.
And, look,

00:18:36.515 --> 00:18:38.750
the drug might genuinely work
and be a major breakthrough,

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:40.586
which would be great,
but the president

00:18:40.586 --> 00:18:42.854
shouldn't be talking it up
like he's filming a testimonial

00:18:42.854 --> 00:18:44.756
for a prescription
drug commercial.

00:18:44.756 --> 00:18:46.891
All that's missing are shots
of him walking on the beach

00:18:46.891 --> 00:18:49.628
and playing guitar with a bunch
of other 70-somethings.

00:18:49.628 --> 00:18:52.230
[ As Trump ]
Yeah, good jam session, fellas.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.565
You know,
when you get to my age,

00:18:53.565 --> 00:18:55.300
physical intimacy
can be a struggle.

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:56.868
That's why I take Regeneron.

00:18:56.868 --> 00:18:59.504
Oh, where are they?

00:18:59.504 --> 00:19:00.538
Where? You guys --

00:19:00.538 --> 00:19:03.575
Melania, where's the Regeneron?

00:19:03.575 --> 00:19:05.577
Mel?!
[ Laughter ]

00:19:05.577 --> 00:19:07.813
Mel, I can't find
my intimacy pills.

00:19:07.813 --> 00:19:09.014
Where you --
Where you threw them --

00:19:09.014 --> 00:19:10.748
You flushed them down the
toilet by accident?

00:19:10.748 --> 00:19:12.317
That keeps happening.

00:19:12.317 --> 00:19:14.819
Well, Mel, I can't be
intimate with --

00:19:14.819 --> 00:19:16.821
I'm not mad, Mel.

00:19:16.821 --> 00:19:20.225
I'm not --
I love you, Mel.

00:19:20.225 --> 00:19:22.894
So Trump's once again
bragging about miracle cures

00:19:22.894 --> 00:19:24.195
he had the luxury of receiving

00:19:24.195 --> 00:19:26.798
during his $100,000
taxpayer-funded hospital stay.

00:19:26.798 --> 00:19:29.134
Meanwhile, his administration
is in court right now,

00:19:29.134 --> 00:19:30.869
suing to rip healthcare
away for millions,

00:19:30.869 --> 00:19:32.170
an outcome they could achieve

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:35.039
if they get their 6-3
Supreme Court supermajority.

00:19:35.039 --> 00:19:36.474
Trump has left
the country in ruins

00:19:36.474 --> 00:19:39.010
and, now, it's up to us
to put it back together.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:40.645
More on that when we come back.

